WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.200
WRYDECO began with a simple belief:

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.400
wood should never lose the character nature gave it.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.200
Every grain, every knot, every curve tells its own story.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:21.200
So we chose to make fewer pieces, each with more meaning and made to last.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.800
In the hands of skilled artisans, the material begins to take shape.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.800
We follow the wood, shaping each surface by hand,

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.600
customized to fit your space.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:36.600
Respect the material. Honor the craft.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.600
Create for the long term.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:43.600
Then, piece by piece, everything comes together.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:47.600
Each branch, shelf, and joint is carefully fitted,

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:52.600
until raw wood becomes a unique functional sculpture.
